                                    SCORE

score is a collection of C++ utilities used in some of my other projects,
primarily cdc_lib. The big thing of note is the binary_io library, providing a
set of helpers to read and write any binary file format.

BUILDING
    You'll need:
      - C++20-compatible compiler
      - CMake
      - Git

    Run the following commands in your shell of choice:
        git clone https://github.com/Hydroloxed/score.git
        cd score
        mkdir build
        cd build
        cmake ..
        cmake --build . --parallel
    
    To run the tests:
        build/tests/score_tests

CODING STYLE
    See STYLE.
